; The landscape tiles
;
; A word for each of the 171 tiles, $00-$AA: the address of its record in
; tile_records. Tile $AA is never in the map: load_map_window draws it instead
; of tile $3E while map_rebuild has bit 7 set.
;
; Many tiles are other tiles turned upside down or mirrored left-right, and
; their records share bytes: the address of such a tile is one, two or three
; bytes before the plain tile's, where the markers that say so lie (see
; tile_records).
;
; Laid out below a word per tile, each with how the tile reads its record and
; how often the map uses it, from the game's bytes when the disassembly is
; built.
